<title>JAPAN: Nippon Konpo Unyu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Konpo Unyu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenue		34.48		vs	   32.65</p>
<p> Operating	    2.46		vs	    2.17</p>
<p> Current		2.37		vs	    2.06</p>
<p> Net		    1.17		vs	    1.10</p>
<p> EPS		   17.80 yen	  vs	   17.21 yen</p>
<p> Shares		66 million	 vs	   64 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Konpo Unyu Soko Co Ltd is the country's largest regional trucking company.</p>
</text>
